# ============================================================================
# _headers — Cloudflare Pages headers config
# ============================================================================
#
# CSP notes (audit pass — read before tightening further):
#
# ⚠️ FIXED: script-src used to also contain 'unsafe-eval'. 'unsafe-eval' lets
# any injected string run as code, which defeats the point of a CSP against
# XSS outright. It was verified unnecessary: a grep across every .js file in the
# project found ZERO uses of eval() or new Function(), and none of the
# externally loaded libraries need it — Firebase compat SDK 10.14.1
# (index.html) / 9.23.0 (blog/index.html), DOMPurify 3.1.7, Chart.js 4.4.1 and
# gtag.js are all eval-free. Removed.
#
# ⚠️ 'unsafe-inline' is still REQUIRED in script-src and is NOT a loose end.
# It is what allows (a) 36 inline <script> blocks and (b) 138 inline on*
# handler attributes (onclick="…") across the HTML files — 109 of the handlers
# are in index.html alone. Inline event-handler attributes are blocked
# outright without 'unsafe-inline', so removing it means converting every one of
# those to addEventListener and every inline script to a nonce or an external
# file. That is a large refactor with real breakage risk, deliberately left out
# of this pass rather than shipped untested. See AUDIT_REPORT.md.
# ============================================================================

/*
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), gyroscope=(), camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self "https://app.fawaterk.com")
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://ssl.google-analytics.com https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://accounts.google.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://*.firebaseio.com https://firebaseapp.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https: http:; media-src 'self' blob: https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com; connect-src 'self' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://analytics.google.com https://region1.google-analytics.com https://stats.g.doubleclick.net https://www.gstatic.com https://apis.google.com https://*.googleapis.com https://*.googleusercontent.com https://*.firebaseio.com https://*.firebasedatabase.app https://*.cloudfunctions.net wss://*.firebaseio.com wss://*.firebasedatabase.app https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com https://securetoken.googleapis.com https://firestore.googleapis.com https://storage.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com https://oauth2.googleapis.com https://app.fawaterk.com https://fawaterk.com; frame-src 'self' https://accounts.google.com https://apis.google.com https://*.firebaseapp.com https://*.firebaseio.com https://app.fawaterk.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://app.fawaterk.com

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Pragma: no-cache

/js/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/css/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800, immutable

/manifest.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /

/api/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store
  Access-Control-Allow-Methods: POST, GET, OPTIONS
  Access-Control-Allow-Headers: Content-Type, Authorization

/blog/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=1800, stale-while-revalidate=86400
  X-Robots-Tag: index, follow

/about/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/contact/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

/privacy/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/terms/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/*.xml
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
  Content-Type: application/xml; charset=UTF-8

/robots.txt
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
